                <pb facs="0111" n="9" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg9"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/6723: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-16T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                                1919, 3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3139. Your urgent 4197, September 13. After consultation with Hoover and Dulles,
                    the Department approves the second line of action mentioned in your
                    telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
